{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "https://excalidraw.com",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "box_3d_canvas",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_3d_canvas",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "1. 3D Canvas (WebGL)\n- STEPメッシュ表示\n- Raycaster交差判定\n- 頂点スナップ (findNearestVertex)\n- 3D交差座標 (x, y, z) 取得",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_1",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 105,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [60, 0]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_state",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 375,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "2. React State (3Dデータ保持)\n- 寸法: 始点・終点・距離 (L, dX, dY, dZ)\n- 注記: 打設座標・テキスト・色\n- カメラ変更検知 (OrbitControls)\n- ピン留めリスト管理",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_2",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 105,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [60, 0]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_project",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_project",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 695,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "3. 射影変換 (projectToScreen)\n- vector.project(camera)\n- カメラ前方/背面判定 (visible)\n- NDC [-1, 1] → 画面ピクセル (sx, sy)\n- 60fps滑らか追従",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_3",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 60,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 60]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_overlay",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#f3d9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_overlay",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 535,
      "y": 245,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "4. HTML / SVG Overlay レイヤー (MeasureAnnotationLayer)\n- SVG層: 寸法線、端点マーカー、引出線 (破線・矢印)\n- HTML層: 寸法数値バッジ (例: 19.94 mm ×)\n- 注記ピン (4色カテゴリ: 青/緑/黄/赤)\n- メモ編集カード (textarea, 最小化, 削除)\n- 左右並べ表示 (Side-by-Side) で新旧完全同期描画",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
  ]
}
